@startuml C4_Code_Backend

title C4 Code Level - FastAPI Backend

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
allowmixing

top to bottom direction

package "FastAPI Backend" {
    
    package "Pydantic Models" {
        
        class TodoModel << Pydantic.BaseModel >> {
          + id: Optional[int]
          + title: str
          + description: Optional[str]
          + due_date: Optional[str]
          + completed: bool
          + size: Optional[int]
        }
        
        class CalModel << Pydantic.BaseModel >> {
          + id: Optional[int]
          + title: str
          + description: Optional[str]
          + date: str
          + start_time: str
          + end_time: str
          + size: Optional[int]
        }
    }
    
    package "Data Access" {
        rectangle "init_data()" as init_data
        rectangle "load_data()" as load_data
        rectangle "save_data()" as save_data
    }
    
    package "Todo Endpoints" as todo_ep {
        rectangle "GET /api/todos" as get_todos
        rectangle "GET /api/todos/{id}" as get_todo
        rectangle "POST /api/todos" as create_todo
        rectangle "PUT /api/todos/{id}" as update_todo
        rectangle "DELETE /api/todos/{id}" as delete_todo
        rectangle "GET /api/todos/overdue" as get_overdue
    }
    
    package "Calendar Endpoints" as cal_ep {
        rectangle "GET /api/calendar/{date}" as get_cal
        rectangle "POST /api/calendar" as create_cal
        rectangle "PUT /api/calendar/{date}" as update_cal
        rectangle "DELETE /api/calendar/{date}" as delete_cal
        rectangle "GET /api/calendar/events" as get_all
    }
    
    package "App Factory" {
        rectangle "FastAPI Instance" as FastAPI
        rectangle "CORS Middleware" as CORS
    }
}

FastAPI --> CORS : adds
init_data --> FastAPI : startup event

FastAPI ..> todo_ep : registers routes
FastAPI ..> cal_ep : registers routes

todo_ep --> load_data : calls
todo_ep --> save_data : calls
cal_ep --> load_data : calls
cal_ep --> save_data : calls

todo_ep --> TodoModel : validates
cal_ep --> CalModel : validates

@enduml